mastery.question_text:
The graph shows a motorist's distance from home. Between which times was the motorist travelling fastest? Justify your answer without calculations.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.8]
\draw[step=1,gray!30] (0,0) grid (5,6);
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,6.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(5.5,0);
